  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Green Lotus Great World, Qin Ding Ling reports that Fang Yuan’s subordinates have broken three defense lines in half a day with nearly twenty Gu Immortals lost. After sensing that attack, Longevity Heaven’s reinforcement to stall her group is treated as a scene Fang Yuan may want.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_green_lotus_great_world",
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan names Ming Hao, Yu Xiu, and Feng Ya as three Heavenly Court female immortals of pseudo venerable battle strength who cultivate wisdom path with star path secondarily. He places Fairy Yu Xiu stronger than Fairy Ming Hao, and says Longevity Heaven had to send reinforcements to stall them into a stalemate. Besides those three, he names rank eight elites such as Qin Ding Ling.",
      "chapters": [
        2162
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-trio",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_fairy_ming_hao",
        "char_fairy_feng_ya",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan sees her combat system for the first time: her attacking methods rely on the difference between the two sides’ attainment levels, and grow stronger as that gap widens. She gathers Heavenly Court immortals and announces a lesson at the peak of Book Mountain open to Gu cultivators, mortal or immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        2162
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-trio",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_book_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Yu Xiu sits at the peak of Book Mountain in Green Lotus Dao field. Inside her immortal aperture, Divine Emperor City’s learning Gu spreads radiance and cooperates with her other Immortal Gu to form the human path killer move Endless Learning. Light-blue radiance covers Gu cultivators on the mountain and raises their attainment levels by creating true meaning in their minds instead of spending the user’s true meaning. The move uses her attainment level, Book Mountain, and learning Gu. She notes that even after natives become Gu Immortals they are still inferior to humans in natural talent and intelligence.",
      "chapters": [
        2163
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "endurance-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_divine_emperor_city",
        "gu_learning_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "move_endless_learning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When most of Green Lotus Dao field’s native Gu Immortals have fallen, Qin Ding Ling’s group still lasts longer. Bai Cang Shui, Zhou Xiong Xin, and Jun Shen Guang faint in turn. Among Heavenly Court members left standing, Gu Yue Fang Zheng faints, then Qin Ding Ling, and Che Wei lasts until the end before Fairy Yu Xiu’s attention shifts to a rock monkey born from a meteor on the mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        2163
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "endurance-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_cang_shui",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "char_che_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the peak of Book Mountain, Che Wei takes the fifth seat, Qin Ding Ling the fourth, Fairy Ming Hao the third, Fairy Yu Xiu the second, and Fairy Feng Ya the main seat.",
      "chapters": [
        2177
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "book-mountain-seats",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
